2- Kubernetes limit/request vererek worker konteynerine tavan/taban belirleme : 

[veritabaniegitimleri@spark-master spark]$ kubectl set resources deployment spark-worker -n spark \
  --limits=cpu=2,memory=3Gi \
  --requests=cpu=1,memory=2Gi


[veritabaniegitimleri@spark-master spark]$ kubectl get pod spark-master-0 -n spark -o yaml | grep -A5 "resources:"

# rollout’u izle
[veritabaniegitimleri@spark-master spark]$ kubectl rollout status deployment/spark-worker -n spark


3- Worker’ların Spark’a bildirilen CORE/MEM ayarı (Spark seviyesi)
Bitnami imajı, worker JVM’ini şu env’lerle başlatır:
SPARK_WORKER_CORES (int)
SPARK_WORKER_MEMORY (örn. 2g, 2048m)
SPARK_MASTER_URL (örn. spark://spark-master-svc:7077)
Bunları deployment üzerinde güncelle:
# örnek: 2 core, 2g bellek
[veritabaniegitimleri@spark-master spark]$ kubectl set env deployment/spark-worker -n spark \
  SPARK_WORKER_CORES=2 SPARK_WORKER_MEMORY=2g

# rolling restart
[veritabaniegitimleri@spark-master spark]$ kubectl rollout restart deployment/spark-worker -n spark
Kural: SPARK_WORKER_MEMORY ≤ (container memory limit – ~300–500Mi JVM/OS payı). Aksi halde worker başlar ama executor’lar “out of memory” veya “cannot reserve” hatası verebilir.

4- Master’ın bellek/ayarlarını güncelleme
Master bir StatefulSet. JVM heap gibi ayarlar için Bitnami’de çoğunlukla SPARK_DAEMON_MEMORY çalışır (örn. 1g):
[veritabaniegitimleri@spark-master spark]$ kubectl set env statefulset/spark-master -n spark SPARK_DAEMON_MEMORY=1g
[veritabaniegitimleri@spark-master spark]$ kubectl rollout restart statefulset/spark-master -n spark

5-  spark-submit ile “işe özel” kaynak vermek
Her job, kendi executor kaynaklarını bağımsız ayarlayabilir:
[veritabaniegitimleri@spark-master spark]$ spark-submit \
  --master spark://<NODE_IP>:31135 \
  --class org.apache.spark.examples.SparkPi \
  --conf spark.executor.instances=2 \
  --conf spark.executor.cores=1 \
  --conf spark.executor.memory=1g \
  $SPARK_HOME/examples/jars/spark-examples_2.13-*.jar 10

6- Versiyon yükseltme / imaj güncelleme
Rolling upgrade:
# worker
[veritabaniegitimleri@spark-master spark]$ kubectl set image deployment/spark-worker -n spark spark=bitnami/spark:4.0.1
[veritabaniegitimleri@spark-master spark]$ kubectl rollout status deployment/spark-worker -n spark

# master
[veritabaniegitimleri@spark-master spark]$ kubectl set image statefulset/spark-master -n spark spark=bitnami/spark:4.0.1
[veritabaniegitimleri@spark-master spark]$ kubectl rollout status statefulset/spark-master -n spark

7- Spark History Server (job geçmişi)

Event log’u aç:
Job gönderirken: --conf spark.eventLog.enabled=true
--conf spark.eventLog.dir=s3a://... ya da PVC’ye mount edilmiş bir klasör.
History Server deployment (PVC ile) yap.
UI’den geçmiş işler, stage’ler, DAG’lar göster.

8- NodePort’u değiştirme/inceleme:
[veritabaniegitimleri@spark-master spark]$ kubectl get svc spark-master-svc -n spark -o wide

# Patch ile NodePort sabitleme
[veritabaniegitimleri@spark-master spark]$ kubectl patch svc spark-master-svc -n spark \
  -p '{"spec":{"type":"NodePort","ports":[{"name":"webui","port":8080,"targetPort":8080,"nodePort":30750},{"name":"spark","port":7077,"targetPort":7077,"nodePort":31135}]}}'


9- Kaynakları temizlemek (lab sıfırlama):
[veritabaniegitimleri@spark-master spark]$ kubectl delete -n spark svc spark-master-svc
[veritabaniegitimleri@spark-master spark]$ kubectl delete -n spark deployment spark-worker
[veritabaniegitimleri@spark-master spark]$ kubectl delete -n spark statefulset spark-master

10- Pendingte kalan podları silmek icin
[veritabaniegitimleri@spark-master spark]$ kubectl delete pod spark-master-0 -n spark --grace-period=0 --force
[veritabaniegitimleri@spark-master spark]$ kubectl delete pod spark-worker-75889d577-xjtjs -n spark --grace-period=0 --force

--grace-period=0 → bekleme süresini 0’a çeker
--force → API server’dan doğrudan etcd kaydını siler (node ile iletişim zorunlu değil)


